# Preserve already-tracked historical CRLF files until a separate
# reviewed, explicit normalization change can update their Git blobs.
# Forcing eol=lf across existing *.ps1 and Markdown paths makes the
# working tree dirty on checkout and breaks create-pull-request.
# Use .editorconfig for the preferred LF behavior in newly edited files.
* text=auto

# Never let Git transform binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
